<%# locals: (verdict:) %>
<% if verdict.requirements.empty? && !verdict.training_signups_allowed %>
  <p>
    Completion of the Online Course is required before signing up for any In-Person Training.
    This requirement does not apply to Advanced Ranger Trainings (ART).
  </p>
  <p>
    Shifts may be signed up for in advance; however, you must attend and successfully complete
    the required In-Person Training before you are permitted to be on duty. Certain positions may
    additionally require successful completion of an Advanced Ranger Training (ART).
  </p>
  <p>
    <b>Note:</b> The Clubhouse may take up to 30 minutes to display completion of the
    Online Course. If more than two hours have passed since completion and your status has not
    updated, contact the Training Academy.
  </p>
  <%= mail_to EmailAddresses::TRAINING_ACADEMY %>
<% else %>
  <p>
    Before the shift can be signed up for, the following issue(s) must be fixed first:
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc list-inside ms-2">
    <% verdict.requirements.each do |req| %>
      <li><%= Scheduling::REQUIREMENT_LABELS[req].html_safe %></li>
    <% end %>
  </ul>
<% end %>
